data mt_mitchell_subject_note: String = "OCP-CONTRIBUTED REFERENCE PLATFORM SPECIFICATION FOR MT. MITCHELL. Usage is under the same OWFa 1.0 / OCP CLA family as Mt. Jade when the document is admitted. THE PUBLISHER LOCATOR REMAINS THE CITATION EVEN WHEN UNREACHABLE. HOW THIS REPOSITORY READ OR FAILED TO READ THAT LOCATOR — INCLUDING ANY MIRROR CAPTURE CITED IN further_citations — IS RECORDED AS GUNBC RECEIPTS WITH DeclarationRefs TO mt_mitchell_reference_platform, NOT AS FIELDS ON THIS RECORD. THIS MODULE IS THE SUBJECT ANCHOR ONLY; PLATFORM FACTS ARE OWNED BY extdeps.ocp.mt_mitchell.platform AND LAND IN #8260."

